Running away with you is the way.

622
00:36:28,370 --> 00:36:29,150
It's so much fun.

623
00:36:29,940 --> 00:36:32,950
Did you even ask if it is for me?

624
00:36:34,520 --> 00:36:35,760
It's ride or die.

625
00:36:36,030 --> 00:36:36,830
You

626
00:36:36,830 --> 00:36:37,570
and I.

627
00:36:39,150 --> 00:36:40,210
