643
00:38:15,190 --> 00:38:17,330
I won't let anyone beat me to it,

644
00:38:17,330 --> 00:38:18,680
even if it's Jam.

645
00:38:18,680 --> 00:38:19,810
We'll see about that.

646
00:39:00,640 --> 00:39:02,120
Let's have dinner at Uncle Mai's Kitchen.

647
00:39:05,640 --> 00:39:06,950
I am not that hungry.

648
00:39:07,120 --> 00:39:07,840
You go ahead and eat.

649
00:39:09,120 --> 00:39:10,120
How come you're not hungry?

650
00:39:10,410 --> 00:39:11,870
You haven't had anything today.

651
00:39:14,430 --> 00:39:16,410
