saying one thing and feeling another.

655
00:39:23,120 --> 00:39:25,320
You said you weren't hungry.

656
00:39:25,370 --> 00:39:26,410
That means you want crabs.

657
00:39:26,410 --> 00:39:27,290
Okay. Got it.

658
00:39:27,290 --> 00:39:27,700
Let's go.

659
00:39:29,630 --> 00:39:30,610
