667
00:39:45,700 --> 00:39:46,600
Sure thing.

668
00:39:46,880 --> 00:39:47,880
If you don't want to go,

669
00:39:48,660 --> 00:39:49,200
I'll carry you.

670
00:39:49,200 --> 00:39:49,810
Hey!

671
00:39:49,810 --> 00:39:50,800
Mr. Sarm, you crazy guy.

672
00:39:50,800 --> 00:39:51,280
Huh?!

673
00:39:51,280 --> 00:39:52,160
"Mr. Sarm, you crazy guy"?

674
00:39:52,160 --> 00:39:53,770
