675
00:39:53,890 --> 00:39:55,230
How dare you call me that?

676
00:39:55,600 --> 00:39:56,320
Let's just go.

677
00:39:56,740 --> 00:39:57,590
You have to come with me.

678
00:39:59,570 --> 00:40:00,200
Now.

679
00:40:00,420 --> 00:40:01,000
Come!

680
00:40:01,200 --> 00:40:02,000
