- I do not want to go.

682
00:40:03,480 --> 00:40:04,470
- Come on!
- Let go!

683
00:40:04,470 --> 00:40:04,880
Now!

684
00:40:04,880 --> 00:40:05,250
Let go!

685
00:40:05,250 --> 00:40:06,000
