- Oh!

686
00:40:06,600 --> 00:40:07,600
Ow...

687
00:40:08,420 --> 00:40:08,810
Oh...

688
00:40:09,360 --> 00:40:09,800
Jam.

689
00:40:10,810 --> 00:40:11,440
Oh.

690
00:40:11,440 --> 00:40:12,000
Ow.

691
00:40:12,150 --> 00:40:12,510
Oh...

692
00:40:12,650 --> 00:40:13,470
There, there.

693
00:40:15,570 --> 00:40:16,000
There!

694
00:40:16,480 --> 00:40:17,220
