696
00:40:18,480 --> 00:40:19,630
I'm sorry. Are you hurt?

697
00:40:20,000 --> 00:40:21,630
I won't be so rough next time.

698
00:40:23,290 --> 00:40:23,620
Feel better.

699
00:40:23,620 --> 00:40:24,320
Feel no pain.

700
00:40:24,750 --> 00:40:25,400
Stop it!

701
00:40:25,400 --> 00:40:25,810
Whoa.

702
00:40:26,000 --> 00:40:27,350
Why do you always do this?

703
00:40:31,310 --> 00:40:32,580
It is not fun for me.

704
00:40:49,280 --> 00:40:50,000
I'm sorry.

705
00:40:51,330 --> 00:40:52,810
I won't be too rough with you again.

706
00:40:54,720 --> 00:40:55,140
Please?

707
00:40:55,290 --> 00:40:55,830
Let's go.

708
00:40:58,400 --> 00:40:59,380
Let's have dinner together.

709
00:41:00,130 --> 00:41:01,790
Let's enjoy tasty food

710
00:41:01,790 --> 00:41:02,590
and crabs.

711
00:41:03,330 --> 00:41:04,360
It'll put you in a better mood.

712
00:41:06,900 --> 00:41:08,000
Let's go get something delicious.

713
00:41:08,000 --> 00:41:08,430
Come on.

714
00:41:09,000 --> 00:41:09,730
Go, go, go.

715
00:41:09,730 --> 00:41:10,000
Come on.

716
00:41:10,000 --> 00:41:10,800
Let's go.

717
00:41:11,730 --> 00:41:12,450
Honestly, you...

718
00:41:12,450 --> 00:41:12,880
Come on.

719
00:41:12,880 --> 00:41:14,320
