725
00:41:40,000 --> 00:41:41,330
Sarm.

726
00:41:43,170 --> 00:41:44,000
Sarm.

727
00:41:51,440 --> 00:41:52,000
Ahem!

728
00:41:53,300 --> 00:41:54,290
Ahem! Ahem!

729
00:42:02,850 --> 00:42:03,670
Lantao.

730
00:42:03,670 --> 00:42:04,340
Yes, Sarm?

731
00:42:05,310 --> 00:42:06,330
Isn't this too close?

732
00:42:06,600 --> 00:42:08,410
