736
00:42:22,810 --> 00:42:23,390
Do you have any?

737
00:42:23,590 --> 00:42:25,220
How would we have that?

738
00:42:25,220 --> 00:42:26,750
This is a seafood restaurant.

739
00:42:27,160 --> 00:42:28,000
Well...

740
00:42:28,000 --> 00:42:29,090
