741
00:42:29,240 --> 00:42:30,600
Let me take care of it.

742
00:42:31,140 --> 00:42:31,540
Mm.

743
00:42:35,230 --> 00:42:37,600
This seafood restaurant
serves a person, too?

744
00:42:42,770 --> 00:42:43,350
Gosh...

745
00:42:51,280 --> 00:42:51,690
Uh...

746
00:42:53,840 --> 00:42:55,520
Lantao was just teasing me.

747
00:42:56,530 --> 00:42:58,800
And you had to play along, too, right?

748
00:43:00,830 --> 00:43:02,590
Just joking around
like friends usually do.

749
00:43:04,200 --> 00:43:05,230
You wouldn't be jealous,

750
00:43:05,230 --> 00:43:05,780
