Oh, oh?

754
00:43:09,820 --> 00:43:10,620
Acting strange now, huh?

755
00:43:11,590 --> 00:43:13,000
You aren't jealous, are you?

756
00:43:13,960 --> 00:43:15,160
Come on, come on.

757
00:43:15,690 --> 00:43:16,320
Are you?

758
00:43:16,880 --> 00:43:17,730
It is not like that.

759
00:43:17,750 --> 00:43:18,290
Hm?

760
00:43:18,310 --> 00:43:19,280
You stubborn little thing.

761
00:43:19,540 --> 00:43:20,260
You are.

762
00:43:20,280 --> 00:43:21,160
You absolutely are.

763
00:43:21,720 --> 00:43:22,460
Aww.

764
00:43:22,490 --> 00:43:23,700
Little Jam's getting jealous.

765
00:43:23,870 --> 00:43:25,130
Little Jam's getting jealous over me.

766
00:43:25,240 --> 00:43:26,520
Little Jam's getting jealous.

767
00:43:26,760 --> 00:43:27,970
Little Jam's getting jealous over me.

768
00:43:28,000 --> 00:43:29,400
Little Jam's getting jealous.

769
00:43:29,560 --> 00:43:30,650
Little Jam's getting jealous over me.

770
00:43:30,770 --> 00:43:31,810
Little Jam's getting jealous.

771
00:43:31,830 --> 00:43:32,270
Little Jam...

772
00:43:32,290 --> 00:43:33,040
Mr. Sarm!

773
00:43:36,650 --> 00:43:37,090
Oh...

774
00:43:37,770 --> 00:43:38,740
Waaah!

775
00:43:38,760 --> 00:43:39,720
Stop that!

776
00:43:42,260 --> 00:43:43,590
Waaah!

777
00:43:43,620 --> 00:43:44,010
Ow.

778
00:43:44,030 --> 00:43:46,920
