peel these crabs for?

779
00:43:58,600 --> 00:43:59,110
Oh.

780
00:43:59,510 --> 00:44:01,460
The Lentao-ils are so sweet…

781
00:44:05,760 --> 00:44:06,610
Mr. Sarm!

782
00:44:08,220 --> 00:44:09,420
I want to head back now.

783
00:44:09,450 --> 00:44:09,800
Oh.

784
00:44:10,410 --> 00:44:11,130
Waaah! Little Jam!

785
00:44:11,160 --> 00:44:12,480
Don't go just yet, Jam.

786
00:44:13,300 --> 00:44:14,710
I got you some liquor on the house.

787
00:44:15,170 --> 00:44:19,000
Let's have a little celebration
to welcome you two back.

788
00:44:21,840 --> 00:44:22,840
Ah. Hey..

789
00:44:23,290 --> 00:44:24,900
