793
00:44:36,310 --> 00:44:37,310
May I have a drink?

794
00:44:38,550 --> 00:44:39,140
One glass.

795
00:44:40,250 --> 00:44:41,080
Half a glass, then.

796
00:44:41,460 --> 00:44:44,180
Someone like you should never drink again.

797
00:44:44,570 --> 00:44:45,600
It's only once in a while.

798
00:44:46,230 --> 00:44:47,170
Just a little bit.

799
00:44:47,190 --> 00:44:47,610
Please?

800
00:44:47,640 --> 00:44:49,130
Just a sip, okay?

801
00:44:49,150 --> 00:44:50,580
Allow me to prepare it for you.

802
00:44:50,820 --> 00:44:51,300
Oh.

803
00:44:51,320 --> 00:44:51,750
Mm.

804
00:44:52,340 --> 00:44:53,330
