820
00:45:17,560 --> 00:45:18,350
Give it all you have got.

821
00:45:19,430 --> 00:45:20,750
Jam, you're amazing.

822
00:45:20,780 --> 00:45:22,520
Leave it to me.

823
00:45:26,070 --> 00:45:26,800
Oh.

824
00:45:27,920 --> 00:45:28,800
Whoa.

825
00:45:30,010 --> 00:45:31,000
