826
00:45:32,250 --> 00:45:33,590
Full strength, just as you requested.

827
00:45:35,240 --> 00:45:36,990
Watch and learn.

828
00:45:45,360 --> 00:45:46,800
You're awesome, Jam.

829
00:45:49,540 --> 00:45:50,760
You're the real deal.

830
00:45:52,180 --> 00:45:52,800
Gosh...

831
00:45:53,280 --> 00:45:55,270
