849
00:47:29,070 --> 00:47:30,590
I am just dizzy.

850
00:47:31,120 --> 00:47:32,900
You are the one who is hammered.

851
00:47:34,030 --> 00:47:35,600
That sobered me right up.

852
00:47:46,770 --> 00:47:48,850
[Mission: Hunt Down the Teeny-tiny Tiger]

853
00:47:48,880 --> 00:47:53,180
My mission was simply
to stay by Mr. Sarm's side

854
00:47:53,220 --> 00:47:55,690
until he got through these hard times.

855
00:47:55,720 --> 00:47:58,710
But the closer I get,
the harder it is to tell

856
00:47:58,740 --> 00:48:02,290
whether he cares for me

857
00:48:02,320 --> 00:48:04,560
or treats everyone this way.

858
00:48:04,590 --> 00:48:08,380
I've been telling myself
not to cross the line,

859
